        -176,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Eligibility math and alert\n\nRequired sessions still ahead are derived from schedule dates later than today, not a static count, so the reachability math stays honest mid-program. When even perfect attendance from here cannot reach the threshold, Slack gets an alert naming the person and the shortfall.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1504,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a065b51a-6c7f-40e6-99cc-c5f7932a907f",
      "name": "Section eligibility",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
